sequenceDiagram
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant CR as CatalogRepository
    participant DAO as ProductDao (Room)
    participant API as ProductApi
    VM->>CR: observeCatalog()
    CR->>DAO: observeAll() (Flow)
    DAO-->>CR: cached list (maybe empty)
    CR-->>VM: Resource.Loading(cached)
    CR->>API: fetchCatalog()
    API-->>CR: List of ProductDto
    CR->>DAO: replaceAll(entities) in transaction
    DAO-->>CR: table changed, Flow re-emits
    CR-->>VM: Resource.Success(freshList)
